{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe charter requires each member to pay a yearly contribution. [[cite:obs-d2b37877425fa49caf395ff5c09e01c5f162acfb \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]\n\nThe annex sets the ordinary contribution at one hundred twenty (120) EUR and specifies it is payable within January. [[cite:obs-5c289f757766f7bdac301f7eee8a9883f091c945 \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"State the charter's rule that members pay a yearly contribution and quote the annex amount and payment timing, with exact-source citations."}